et by Alison Aimes consist of 3 Darkish, Fated Mates, Omegaverse novellas with an insta-feel yet the romance feels genuine &amp; not rushed, there's also some action-suspense components with gives them an edge, &amp; a sweet HEA! I've read all 3 seperately before listening and I wholeheartedly recommend them! They're in the wider Alphaverse by Alison but can be read/listened standalone. Thank you so much to Alison for my audiobook copy 🥰.<br /><br />Magnus, the exiled alpha king looking for revenge meets his match in Amora, an omega with a volatile gift who had only ever wanted a place to belong in "Forbidden Flame".<br />Pavel (Mag's subordinate), an outlaw with a haunted past finds his angel Ari when she literally crashes into him from above, Have they really lived different lives or do they have the same lawless heart? Find in "Princess Claimed". (These two books are set in the forbidden sector!)<br />See the beginning of this Alphaverse in Prequel "War Prize of the Beast" as Cheim saves the omega-in-distress Anara &amp; takes her as his prize!<br /><br />The audiobook narration is by duet Samantha Brentmoor, JF Harding is so amazing. Their voices are smooth, pleasant &amp; easy to understand. I especially LOVED how Harding narrated the side characters &amp; how both of them made those distinguishable. They didn't sound flat and had appropriate emotions for all scenes. I feel so happy 🥰. Definitely recommend!<br /><br />✨Audiobook+Story ratings:<br /><br />1) The characters: 5/5<br />2) The feels: 😃😅😣🤯🤩😘😉🧐😍😏😬😍<br />3) Story conflicts &amp; creativity: 4.5/5<br />4) World development: 5/5<br />5) Relationship: 5/5<br />6) Sexy/Steamy times: 3.5/5 (especially Princess Claimed, that's the hottest!)<br />7) Levels: Mildly Low Angst, surprisingly adorbs, Mild Dark<br />8) POV &amp; Writing style: 3rd Person, Dual POV - 4.7/5<br />9) Flow &amp; Enjoy: 5/5<br />10) Voice acting: 5/5<br /><br />** #arcHonestReview #AllViewsAreMyOwn **<br /><br /><a href="https://m.facebook.com/ToonasaLovesBooks/" rel="nofollow noopener">FB Page</a> | <a href="https://www.instagram.com/toonasa.loves.books/" rel="nofollow noopener">Instagram</a> | <a href="https://www.bookbub.com/profile/89245731" rel="nofollow noopener">Bookbub</a> | <a href="https://m.facebook.com/groups/164936121697459/" rel="nofollow noopener">FB group</a></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=aliens" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">aliens</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=all-the-feels_laugh-cry-anger" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">all-the-feels_laugh-cry-anger</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=arc-beauty-2023" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">arc-beauty-2023</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">3 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6