6 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5564967918">May 21, 2023</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Steamy, Fascinating &amp; Out of this World! Great Story &amp; Narration🎧<br /><br />Forbidden Warlords in Love: A Dark Fated-Mated Romance Box Set<br />Ruthless Warlords Series Standalones<br />By: Alison Aimes<br />Narrated by: J.F. Harding, Samantha Brentmoor<br /><br />This great box set contains three amazing and out of this world novellas set in Alison Aimes “Ruthless Warlords” series, each story features different lead characters and stands on its own. Each one is just as fascinating as the other, starting with “Forbidden Flame” an alpha crime boss exiled to the forbidden sector is plotting his revenge and he finds his way in, by delivering a package, a package he was not supposed to see, but then the contents of it moves, so he had to check what it was and surprised at what he finds, not just a fiery omega, someone his enemy wants as a tool, but she is his mate. The second story, Princess Claimed”, an ex-convict exiled to the forbidden sector runs a shipping business with a partner who drops by occasionally, since he prefers to be a loner. His life changes when an angel falls from the sky and into his arms. She has no memory of who she was, where she came from or how she got there. He knows she is his mate, but he still tries to find out who she is and then memories come back to her, and she fears she will put him in danger. Can their relationship even be? The third story, “War Prize of the Beast” is the most barbaric of the three, the beast found his prey, but the prey turns into something much more, something sweet and delicious, his mate. I loved the originality of these stories, they are fascinating and imaginative, and have plenty of drama, action, twists and turns, and steam. Alison Aimes, thank you for these amazing stories and the fascinating omega verse. <br /><br />🎧📚🎧 And for the fantastic narration, J.F. Harding and Samantha Brentmoor did an amazing job bringing these characters to life and did so with a complete understanding of who they were portraying, giving each their own distinct voice and personality. I loved how they took each role and made it their own and they were believable in every role they played. They set the perfect tone for each story, captured all the characters emotions and projected them into their performance. These entertaining storytellers are a versatile voice artists and a pleasure to listen to. Thank you for another amazing listen. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.011203