"<br /><br />🖤 Princess Claimed 🖤<br /><br />Pavel was exiled to the Forbidden Sector. He's happy where he's at with the few "friends" he has. He doesn't need anything else. Until a princess falls from the sky... literally. I loved Pavel and Ari together! Ari has so much sass and I loved that even though she was Omega, she definitely made her Alpha work for it!<br /><br />✮🖤✮ Favorite quotes ✮🖤✮<br /><br />“I’ve shown you mine. Now, since you know I can handle it, show me what you got, convict.”<br /><br />“I intended to spend the rest of the rotation worshipping you as you deserve.”<br /><br />🖤 War Prize of the Beast 🖤<br /><br />I loved this story of how Cheim &amp; Anara go from Hunter and prey to Alpha and Omega! Cheim has only ever known hunting and killing and it was so sweet when he realized that Anara was his. Anara was so patient with Cheim and taught him happiness.<br /><br />✮🖤✮ Favorite quotes ✮🖤✮<br /><br />"Yes good little prey."<br /><br />"Mine to leash no matter how high you soar."<br /><br />✮🎧✮ Audiobook Review ✮🎧✮<br /><br />J.F. Harding &amp; Samantha Brentmoore we're awesome for all three of the stories in this box set! They made the characters come to life and I loved how their voices sounded so different from each story! From sweet and innocent to growly and demanding. This duo was great!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/90133321?shelf=2023-reads" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2023-reads</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/90133321?shelf=jp" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">jp</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/90133321?shelf=pnr" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">pnr</s