 />Omega Amora Rose has an unusual attribute. Making finding a fated mate impossible. When she and Magnus come face to face, partial mating bands appear. Is it too much to hope for?<br /><br />Gritty and dark as promised, but also so much more. I thoroughly enjoyed this story.<br /><br />*****Princess Claimed*****<br />Angelic Princess and Bad-Boy Alien!!<br /> <br />Ari is running for her life on an important mission. Her escape from the Destiny, a luxury cruise liner, results in her falling into Pavel’s arms in the Forbidden Sector, and a loss of memory. Pavel is scarred, coarse and caring. He is also her fated mate - as the marks which appeared dignify. Can a criminal mate a princess?<br /> <br />Raw and sensual. Fate cannot be ignored.<br /><br />***** War Prize of the Beast *****<br /><br />A fierce predator meets his match. Used to running from gerlex; Anara sees even they run from the newly arrived beserkeths. An electric pulse on contact changes both their lives. Gritty and steamy.<br /><br />***** I am voluntarily leaving my honest review of this book *****<br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,1