an class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5550552737">May 15, 2023</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">~*~ Audiobook Review ~*~ Forbidden Warlords in Love is a box set of books 6-8 of the dark omegaverse, fated-mates series. All three books are exciting page turners based on Alison Aimes omegaverse. I have really enjoyed the series so far, so I knew I would easily be swept up in this audiobook narrated in DUET! These Alphas all live in The Forbidden sector, which is unplanned, unregulated, and lawless. The Alphas are demanding, cocky, determined to remain alone, and each is the perfect match for each individual Omega. Alison delivers female characters who are unique and retain their self awareness and self worth in this Alpha/Omega universe, which is a tricky thing to do. <br /><br />Forbidden Flame tells the story of Magnus and Amora Rose. He is bent on revenge and she just wants to fit in somewhere. Her gift is volatile and unique, and their pairing is perfection. Princess Claimed features Ari, who is on the run and has no memory of who she is or where she came from. Pavl is an outlaw living in exile when she quite literally falls into his arms. War Price of the Beast is an enemies to lovers, forced proximity, super hawt love story of Cheim, who views himself as a beast, incapable love, simply a predator. Anara is on the run and believes the same about Alphas. Until they meet and everything changes. Each story is a page turner with unique storylines. I’m so glad Alison has bundled these three novellas together! They fit well and help expand the dark omegaverse world I have really enjoyed!<br /><br />All three books are narrated in DUET by J.F. Hardin and Samantha Brentmoor and their performances are excellent! They work well together and the editing is well done. This is a dark omegaverse world, so the right voices are so important! Their subtle vocal changes really bring the various characters to life. I’m narrator motivated, and this is the reason!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/99207393?shelf=dark" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dark</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.1036344 16.440983,18.1036344 L9.66834148,18.1034086 C9.31027068,18.6437214 8.696742,19 8,19 L6,19 C4.8954305,19 4,18.1045695 4,17 L4,12 C4