ntha Brentmoor<br /><br />Get ready for the spice, the alpha and omega and the suspense! This collection of stories is hot, hot, hot! Starting with Forbidden Flame. Magnus has been exiled for a crime he didn't. Not sitting back and taking it, he is ready to take revenge, intercepting a package. Little does he know what is inside could be the secret to his redemption. Amora has a special power, but even not touching her, he know just who he is. His fated mate. Forbidden Princess is next giving Pavel his one and only. This alpha knew immediately Ari was for him, but after her accident, she has no recollection of who she is. When they find out, will things change? Incredible chemistry, but will that be enough? Lastly, Anora and Kyme burn through the earbuds as he wins his omega, finding out there is much more to her than his usual reward. Will his fated mate be his true match? These novellas as quick stories with good plots and great characters. If sci-fi romance is your choice, this box set is for you! <br /><br />Each of these stories is brought to life by JF Harding and Samantha Brentmoor. These two are fantastic, bringing different voices to the characters, keeping the action moving and spice factor high! I loved how each story had it's own voices, with many secondary characters coming to life too. It's an amazing listen.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17