ks are exciting page turners based on Alison Aimes omegaverse. I have really enjoyed the series so far, so I knew I would easily be swept up in this audiobook narrated in DUET! These Alphas all live in The Forbidden sector, which is unplanned, unregulated, and lawless. The Alphas are demanding, cocky, determined to remain alone, and each is the perfect match for each individual Omega. Alison delivers female characters who are unique and retain their self awareness and self worth in this Alpha/Omega universe, which is a tricky thing to do. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eForbidden Flame tells the story of Magnus and Amora Rose. He is bent on revenge and she just wants to fit in somewhere. Her gift is volatile and unique, and their pairing is perfection. Princess Claimed features Ari, who is on the run and has no memory of who she is or where she came from. Pavl is an outlaw living in exile when she quite literally falls into his arms. War Price of the Beast is an enemies to lovers, forced proximity, super hawt love story of Cheim, who views himself as a beast, incapable love, simply a predator. Anara is on the run and believes the same about Alphas. Until they meet and everything changes. Each story is a page turner with unique storylines. I’m so glad Alison has bundled these three novellas together! They fit well and help expand the dark omegaverse world I have really enjoyed!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAll three books are narrated in DUET by J.F. Hardin and Samantha Brentmoor and their performances are excellent! They work well together and the editing is well done. This is a dark omegaverse world, so the right voices are so important! Their subtle vocal changes really bring the various characters to life. I’m narrator motivated, and this is the reason!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ANIL261XHKCH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.9quM2irob3bELAWr\"}}"},"likeCou